Tokenizer assets for the pinned Qwen3.8-27B reference capability
(objective 021, docs/CACHE-TOKEN-COMPILER-CONTRACT.md).

Source: Hugging Face repository `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`, pinned revision
`37561816e66b5b9153b1b64c10968c18c1e6f4a0` (Apache-2.0).

Files (exact sizes and SHA-256 digests are closed constants of the
tokenizer contract and verified at load time):

- tokenizer.json         12809320 bytes
- tokenizer_config.json    9984 bytes
- chat_template.jinja      9004 bytes
- LICENSE                 11544 bytes (Apache License 2.0, verbatim)

These assets are CPU tokenizer artifacts only. They contain no model
weights, no training data, and no serving configuration. The adapter
loads them once from the package at startup of the v1 tokenizer
component; it never downloads, re-encodes or re-serializes them at
runtime, and never calls a hosted tokenizer endpoint.

The reference RTX 3090 serving work that informed the local Qwen
deployment remains credited as `syv-ai/qwen38-27b-rtx3090`.
